1. The disassembled game source (src/elite/, src/elite_de/, src/elite_fr/, apart from the files named in 3)
   It is a disassembly of the original game's code. The names, labels and comments are mine, but they cannot be separated from the code, which stays under the original copyright. It is published for study and preservation: you may read it, learn from it and build it for your own use from your own copy of the game. No licence is granted beyond that: nothing here allows redistributing the game, the source, or disks built from it. Ask the rights holders, not me.

2. The mission code (src/elite/missions_*.asm, src/disk/)
   It is my own work, but it only runs inside the original binary and follows the logic of other versions of the game. It is treated like item 1: no licence is granted.

3. Material by Fessor (the ship hulls, including the Constrictor: src/elite/missions_hull.asm, src/elite/missions_ships.asm, tools/fessor_ships.py, the ship packs, docs/_ship_packs.md)
